      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start for the atmosphere, really moody. But I need more specifics to make it feel real. Can you zoom in on the people walking these streets? I want to get a sense of who actually lives there—what they look like, what they're wearing, and that general vibe of the crowd so the reader knows exactly what kind of environment they've stepped into. Just describe the people hanging out on the corners or walking through the alleys.",
